  "solution": "Từ hình vẽ, ta thấy\n\t\t<ul><li>Vận tốc dòng nước là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (km/h).<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Vận tốc ca nô là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>35</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (km/h).</li><li>Vậy vận tốc của ca nô so với bờ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ul>\n\t\tXét <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math> có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>53</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy vận tốc của ca nô so với bờ là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>53</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math> (km/h).",
